Package: ib-traffic-monitor
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/NVIDIA/ib-traffic-monitor
Description: InfiniBand traffic monitor and Prometheus exporter
 ib-traffic-monitor reports the metrics of the local InfiniBand devices read
 from /sys/class/infiniband: link status, per-second traffic counters and
 cumulative error counters.
 .
 It runs either as an ncurses TUI or, with --daemon, headless as a Prometheus
 exporter serving /metrics over HTTP. This package ships a systemd service for
 the headless mode, configured through /etc/default/ib-traffic-monitor.
